 immediately before this.attachRequestMeta(req, parsedUrl) in requestHandler: the
 locale query params are validated against the configured i18n locales and deleted
 when i18n is absent or a value is not a configured locale. A regression test that
 encodes the same predicate is added at test/cve-2024-51479.test.js.
